;PvP effects

; No change
Global Const $fluxOdransRazor = 3393 ; Jan

; Skills from your secondary profession deal 30% more damage to foes with that primary profession.
Global Const $fluxAmmateurHour = 3392 ; Feb

; You have a +2 bonus to all of the secondary attributes of your secondary profession.
Global Const $fluxHiddenTalent = 2792 ; March

; You deal an additional 30% damage to foes of the same primary profession.
; Killing a foe of the same primary profession restores all your Health and Energy, and you get a 5% morale boost.
Global Const $fluxThereCanBeOnlyOne = 3357 ; April

; If you do not have an elite skill equipped, you have +2 to all attributes, +2 Health regeneration, and +1 Energy regeneration.
Global Const $fluxMeekShallInherit = 2810 ; May

; If all your attribute lines are between 8-11, not counting buffs,
; then your skills deal 15% additional damage, activate 25% faster, and cost 20% less Energy
Global Const $fluxJackOfAllTrades = 3391 ; June

; Whenever you use a skill with a different attribute than the last skill you used,
; you gain a 5% stacking damage bonus (maximum 30%).
; This bonus resets if you use a skill with the same attribute as the last skill you used.
Global Const $fluxChainCombo = 3387 ; July

; Whenever you successfully activate a skill, it is disabled for 3 seconds for:
; all members of your party
; all members of the opposing party
Global Const $fluxXinrae = 2794 ; August

; Kill the boss (or any player if there is no boss); now you're the boss:
; -20 armor, +33% attack speed, +33% move speed, -33% skill activation time, +3 Health regeneration, and +1 Energy regeneration
Global Const $fluxLikeABoss = 3394 ; September
Global Const $fluxLikeABoss_TheBoss = 3395

; Any time a player dies, all nearby creatures are struck for 50 damage and a level 20 masterless bone horror is spawned.
Global Const $fluxMinionApocalpyse = 2737 ; October

; If all the skills on your bar use the same attribute,
; you gain +3 hp regeneration and +100hp
; and your skills cost 25% less Energy.
Global Const $fluxAllIn = 3390 ; November

; If you die, you drop a bundle on the ground that grants bonuses to whoever picks it up.
; See also https://wiki.guildwars.com/wiki/Gift_of_Battle 3404
Global Const $fluxPartingGift = 3403; December
